      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.The original test has many unused imports and unused fields. I'll clean those up and improve readability while keeping the same test logic.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed ~60 unused imports, removed unused `TEST` and `PARIS` fields, renamed `MAX_LENGTH` to `MAX_DAY_OF_MONTH` for clarity, renamed the loop variable from `i` to `day`, and added a brief comment on the expected `toString` format — all while preserving the same three test methods with identical behavior."
